    "innovation": "This paper highlights statistical difficulties in defining Arctic amplification as a ratio, distinguishing between 'Ratio of Means' and 'Mean Ratio' estimators to demonstrate that this approach leads to greater, and sometimes unbounded, uncertainty in future climate projections than previously reported, particularly under low-emission scenarios.",
